	(text "so no 3.3 V is ever driven into an unpowered FD6288 (abs max VIN <= VCC+0.3 V).  R440 4.7k keeps Vsg(Q46) < 0.45 V when off (SPICE); R442 keeps the weapon off if the Pico pin floats."
